; Write-only JTAG shift for long DR scans (an FPGA bitstream): TDI only, TMS held at its last level (low in
; Shift-DR), nothing sampled. Two instructions per TCK; TCK is side-set. The TX FIFO is fed by DMA with whole
; 32-bit words (autopull, shift right: bit 0 of byte 0 first). With the FIFO empty the `out` stalls with TCK low.
.program jtag_write
.side_set 1

.wrap_target
    out pins, 1 side 0
    nop         side 1
.wrap
